---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { siteMeta } from '../lib/site';
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description={`About ${siteMeta.name}.`}>
  <article class="page">
    <p class="identity">{siteMeta.name} / about</p>
    <h1>About</h1>
    <p>
      I am an AI systems engineer and ETH Zurich MSc student based in Zurich. My work sits between
      research and product: LLM agents, production AI systems, accelerated computing, and practical
      tools for reasoning about complex workflows.
    </p>

    <h2>Work</h2>
    <p>
      Professionally, I build LLM-based products end to end: full-stack web apps, Python services,
      real-time voice agents, automated feedback, and cloud deployment. I care about systems that
      are useful enough to leave the demo stage.
    </p>

    <h2>Research</h2>
    <p>
      At ETH, I am focused on self-improving LLM agents for CUDA kernel development. Recent work
      also touches agent/database co-design, GPU-backed systems, and evaluation loops that turn
      profiling or runtime feedback into better decisions.
    </p>

    <h2>Writing</h2>
    <p>
      This site will collect occasional notes on AI systems, engineering tradeoffs, research ideas,
      and the things I want to understand more clearly by writing them down.
    </p>

    <h2>Colophon</h2>
    <p>
      This site is built with Astro, Markdown, and a little CSS. It is static by default, deploys
      cleanly to GitHub Pages, and should be easy to carry somewhere else later.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
